# The root .gitignore excludes `dist` everywhere, which is right for build
# output. These two files are different: they are the design tokens in the
# only forms the build tools can read (CommonJS for the native app's
# Tailwind v3 config, CSS variables for the web apps' v4 @theme), and
# neither tool can import TypeScript at config-load time.
#
# Committing them means a fresh clone builds with no codegen step. The
# drift test in src/index.test.ts regenerates both and fails if either is
# stale, so a committed artefact cannot silently disagree with its source.
!dist/
!dist/tailwind.cjs
!dist/tokens.css
